  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"593\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"225\">About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"228\">Ni-Howdy is a Texas based Asian-American food brand built seed oil free and clean-label flavor lovers. We launched with our fan-favorite Sichuan Chili Crunch — a crispy, tingly, Texas-born chili oil that's 100% seed oil-free, made with real ingredients, and packed with flavor (no preservatives).</p><p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"881\"><strong data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"625\">What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"628\">Unlike other condiments loaded with canola and soy oil, Ni-Howdy is seed oil free and always clean label. Our products are small-batch, chef-developed, and made for people who actually care what they’re eating.&nbsp;</p><p data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"1099\"><strong data-start=\"883\" data-end=\"913\">How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"916\">We’re offering a massive <strong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"959\">30% commission</strong> on every sale you refer — one of the highest rates in the food industry. No minimums, no fluff. Just real payouts for creators who believe in real food.</p><p data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1101\" data-end=\"1125\">How to promote us:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1392\"><li data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1191\"><p data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1191\">Show your favorite clean-label meals using our chili crunch</p></li><li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1263\"><p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1263\">Talk about the dangers of seed oils and how we’re changing the game (we're happy to help educate on this if you have questions)</p></li><li data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1331\"><p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1331\">Share our mission with your foodie, wellness, or paleo audience</p></li><li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1392\"><p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1392\">Use your unique discount code to drive trust and urgency</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1537\"><strong data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1418\">Other information:</strong><br>We ask that you tag us in all your posts @nihowdyfoodco and allow us to reuse your content. Collaborative posts on Instagram are our favorite. <br><br data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1421\">You will receive free product samples available for qualified creators. Cookie duration: 30 days. Payouts via Venmo or Bank Transfer. No fees. No BS.</p><p data-start=\"1539\" data-end=\"1640\">Join us in the fight against fake food and let’s build a spicy, seed oil-free future together</p></div>",
